WEBVTT

00:00:01.840 --> 00:00:05.780
Our dear freshmen! Congratulations on your admittance.

00:00:06.360 --> 00:00:08.570
On this beautiful spring day,

00:00:08.570 --> 00:00:14.240
you are embarking on a new chapter of your lives as students of Sakimori Academy.

00:00:14.760 --> 00:00:18.280
As your senior, I welcome all of you to this school,

00:00:18.280 --> 00:00:20.040
and to some degree, to a new life.

00:00:20.040 --> 00:00:23.370
I am truly looking forward to learning alongside you.

00:00:24.310 --> 00:00:30.150
You may find this new life bound by the school's regulations and far from your parents

00:00:30.150 --> 00:00:32.740
somewhat off-putting or even arduous.

00:00:37.490 --> 00:00:41.780
<i>I have no memories of anything up until junior high.</i>

00:00:42.400 --> 00:00:43.270
<i>That's why...</i>

00:00:47.220 --> 00:00:51.860
<i>...I couldn't chat like everybody else.</i>

00:00:54.050 --> 00:00:56.440
<i>I don't know anything about myself.</i>

00:00:57.280 --> 00:00:59.970
<i>Am I a kindhearted person?</i>

00:00:59.970 --> 00:01:03.210
<i>Am I cheerful? What's my family like?</i>

00:01:03.860 --> 00:01:05.290
<i>Do I have any friends?</i>

00:01:05.780 --> 00:01:07.210
<i>What are my favorite things?</i>

00:01:08.630 --> 00:01:14.300
<i>Before getting to know others, I had to know about myself.</i>

00:01:15.410 --> 00:01:19.080
<i>What kind of a person is Nobi Marie?</i>

00:01:20.100 --> 00:01:24.730
<i>I never did find an answer to that question.</i>

00:01:25.230 --> 00:01:27.030
Then how about today?

00:01:27.030 --> 00:01:27.730
Is that okay?

00:01:27.730 --> 00:01:29.730
Totally! I wanna check out some accessories anyway.

00:01:29.730 --> 00:01:31.640
That shop's got a really good selection.

00:01:31.640 --> 00:01:33.660
Their stuff is super cute!

00:03:09.120 --> 00:03:10.180
What?

00:03:10.990 --> 00:03:14.460
Marie? Don't tell me you're a—

00:03:14.460 --> 00:03:16.800
Nobi Marie, did you enter a Valvrave?

00:03:17.550 --> 00:03:18.600
Huh?

00:03:19.250 --> 00:03:20.550
What's going on?

00:03:29.540 --> 00:03:33.190
This is unbelievable. All they did was augment our machines with Valvrave tech.

00:03:33.750 --> 00:03:38.970
Both Colonel Cain and the Valvraves go way beyond human understanding.

00:03:47.320 --> 00:03:48.900
X! Fall Back!

00:03:48.900 --> 00:03:52.000
It used up this much power?

00:03:52.400 --> 00:03:54.500
Yamada! Get up!

00:03:54.500 --> 00:03:57.300
We're holy spirits, remember? You're not dead, right?

00:03:58.720 --> 00:04:00.260
I wish I were...

00:04:00.260 --> 00:04:04.890
Looks like I overheated. Can't move.

00:04:05.280 --> 00:04:08.030
Löwenglitzen emission test complete.

00:04:08.030 --> 00:04:11.020
Difference from the theoretical value: 0.007%.

00:04:11.380 --> 00:04:15.020
Captain X-Ein, proceed to phase 8 once your energy packs are replaced.

00:04:15.380 --> 00:04:16.510
Blitzendegen!

00:04:16.510 --> 00:04:18.360
Replacing energy packs.

00:04:33.680 --> 00:04:35.920
Man, those look sweet!

00:04:35.920 --> 00:04:39.150
I wanna pilot a Kirschbaum, too, next time!

00:04:39.150 --> 00:04:41.420
All units, retreat!

00:04:41.680 --> 00:04:45.010
I saw the JIORians further up ahead.

00:04:45.670 --> 00:04:47.560
This is one of L-Elf's plan.

00:04:47.560 --> 00:04:50.120
The other Valvraves will be waiting somewhere in ambush.

00:04:50.120 --> 00:04:51.640
Don't go around issuing orders!

00:04:52.040 --> 00:04:53.290
<i>What should I do?</i>

00:04:52.430 --> 00:04:54.780
I am in charge here!

00:04:53.290 --> 00:04:56.650
<i>L-Elf's plan was to lure them onto the high ground</i>

00:04:54.780 --> 00:04:56.070
It's way too dangerous.

00:04:56.070 --> 00:04:56.650
What is?

00:04:56.650 --> 00:04:59.650
<i>and then blow their footing away with the bombs.</i>

00:04:59.650 --> 00:05:01.270
L-Elf is around.

00:05:01.270 --> 00:05:03.530
He knows this area like the back of his hand.

00:05:03.530 --> 00:05:05.480
No doubt is he trying to make use of a certain spot.

00:05:05.480 --> 00:05:06.530
What spot?

00:05:05.480 --> 00:05:06.530
All or nothing.

00:05:13.320 --> 00:05:15.800
We know of five Valvraves, but only two showed up so far.

00:05:15.800 --> 00:05:18.270
He must have some reason not to deploy them all at once.

00:05:16.800 --> 00:05:19.670
A-Drei? He's part of lunar orbital forces. Why is he here?

00:05:20.040 --> 00:05:21.820
I bet he's trying to bait us.

00:05:22.980 --> 00:05:26.680
H-Neun! L-Elf is hiding in the cave.

00:05:26.680 --> 00:05:29.570
Blow them up from above. Destroy the bedrock.

00:05:29.570 --> 00:05:30.700
Are you sure?

00:05:30.700 --> 00:05:34.420
He wants to settle things in the very place where we've sinned together.

00:05:34.420 --> 00:05:35.890
Don't you feel the hand of fate at work?

00:05:36.610 --> 00:05:37.770
He's here, huh?

00:05:38.770 --> 00:05:39.920
Did something happen up top?

00:05:39.920 --> 00:05:42.650
There are people out there who know about me and this cave.

00:05:43.280 --> 00:05:45.400
We'll only catch half of their forces like this,
but we have no other choice.

00:05:45.760 --> 00:05:47.570
Podded missiles, fire!

00:06:04.230 --> 00:06:05.380
L-Elf!

00:06:05.380 --> 00:06:06.680
Did you really—

00:06:28.720 --> 00:06:30.500
The Valvraves?

00:06:30.500 --> 00:06:34.370
Yes. I was informed they came to Earth.

00:06:35.000 --> 00:06:38.000
By whom, if I may ask?

00:06:38.630 --> 00:06:43.480
I have a few friends too, you know.

00:06:43.480 --> 00:06:49.460
Besides, doesn't a country of students pique your interest as well?

00:07:01.700 --> 00:07:04.250
A-Drei! Where are you?

00:07:04.880 --> 00:07:06.570
A-Drei!

00:07:19.440 --> 00:07:21.710
Marie? L-Elf?

00:07:32.560 --> 00:07:34.160
The Valvrave...

00:07:34.160 --> 00:07:35.640
Are you awake?

00:07:47.540 --> 00:07:49.820
Worry not. I no longer intend to shoot you.

00:07:50.310 --> 00:07:52.710
We're stranded here thanks to the cave-in.

00:07:52.710 --> 00:07:55.070
We'll have to use Unit 1 to get out.

00:07:55.640 --> 00:07:56.860
Are you listening?

00:07:57.400 --> 00:07:58.630
I am.

00:07:59.280 --> 00:08:02.500
I'm just a little overwhelmed right now...

00:08:05.730 --> 00:08:07.010
What's wrong?

00:08:07.010 --> 00:08:09.510
My wounds are gone.

00:08:09.510 --> 00:08:10.460
Why?

00:08:12.100 --> 00:08:14.590
You aren't familiar with your own body?

00:08:15.140 --> 00:08:16.550
I don't know.

00:08:16.550 --> 00:08:18.660
Am I the same as Haruto?

00:08:18.660 --> 00:08:23.230
What kind of a person am I? Why are my memories missing?

00:08:23.230 --> 00:08:24.280
Your memories?

00:08:24.280 --> 00:08:27.970
Yeah! I only have memories from the last two years.

00:08:27.970 --> 00:08:29.480
I used them.

00:08:30.120 --> 00:08:31.820
You again?

00:08:31.820 --> 00:08:34.740
I used them.

00:08:47.920 --> 00:08:49.340
It's melting?!

00:08:51.300 --> 00:08:53.340
Still no word from L-Elf?

00:08:53.340 --> 00:08:55.120
He hasn't checked in!

00:08:55.120 --> 00:08:57.070
I'm more worried about Units 3 and 5!

00:08:57.070 --> 00:08:58.530
And what about Haruto's Unit 1?

00:08:58.530 --> 00:08:59.840
We lost contact!

00:09:00.570 --> 00:09:01.880
Should I go check?

00:09:01.880 --> 00:09:04.560
Too dangerous! We have to wait for L-Elf!

00:09:06.130 --> 00:09:08.280
Still no signal...

00:09:08.770 --> 00:09:11.700
Even though I'm ready and waiting to hack the ship!

00:09:20.710 --> 00:09:22.660
They're finally here!

00:09:22.960 --> 00:09:26.420
There are too many! We can't deal with them all!

00:09:26.870 --> 00:09:29.630
So the ground forces are trying to save face, huh?

00:09:29.630 --> 00:09:31.740
We seem to be doing just fine on our own.

00:09:31.740 --> 00:09:34.550
X-Ein, H-Neun! Retreat!

00:09:34.550 --> 00:09:35.430
What?

00:09:35.880 --> 00:09:40.150
We are only here to test the Kirschbaums.

00:09:40.150 --> 00:09:44.600
And sadly, this is outside of our jurisdiction.

00:09:58.620 --> 00:10:00.650
Are you okay?

00:10:00.650 --> 00:10:02.590
Get a grip, K-Zwölf!

00:10:08.970 --> 00:10:09.540
Wait!

00:10:09.880 --> 00:10:13.050
Calm down, K-Zwölf!

00:10:14.490 --> 00:10:15.420
K?

00:10:16.510 --> 00:10:17.390
K-Z—

00:10:18.100 --> 00:10:19.850
I sent out an SOS already.

00:10:20.450 --> 00:10:21.640
Don't worry.

00:10:23.040 --> 00:10:24.050
Right.

00:10:24.050 --> 00:10:26.770
You haven't mastered mental control yet, I see.

00:10:26.770 --> 00:10:27.960
I...

00:10:27.960 --> 00:10:29.370
I won't blame you, then.

00:10:29.910 --> 00:10:31.540
Just calm down.

00:10:31.540 --> 00:10:32.570
I'm here with you.

00:10:33.450 --> 00:10:34.870
<i>What should I do now?</i>

00:10:34.870 --> 00:10:36.340
<i>The plan's bust.</i>

00:10:37.000 --> 00:10:39.060
<i>I can't get in touch with the others with him around.</i>

00:10:43.780 --> 00:10:44.500
Captain?

00:10:44.500 --> 00:10:46.000
Step to the right.

00:10:46.000 --> 00:10:47.870
Yes, sir.

00:11:03.920 --> 00:11:06.470
This sure takes me back.

00:11:18.780 --> 00:11:23.890
I underwent Karlstein training here just like you.

00:11:25.000 --> 00:11:31.300
However, a number of facts came to light that forced me to kill a friend.

00:11:32.470 --> 00:11:35.000
Right here on this shore.

00:11:35.840 --> 00:11:41.580
My friend was connected to the
royalists—supporters of the old order.

00:11:42.250 --> 00:11:46.820
If the army found out that we had a royalist on our team,

00:11:46.820 --> 00:11:50.300
the entire team would have been held responsible for the crime.

00:11:51.670 --> 00:11:54.350
H-Neun. X-Ein.

00:11:54.350 --> 00:11:56.900
Q-Vier. Me.

00:11:57.460 --> 00:11:58.650
And L-Elf.

00:11:58.650 --> 00:12:00.650
What crime?

00:12:01.160 --> 00:12:02.450
A capital offense.

00:12:04.050 --> 00:12:08.200
So we killed our friend in secret...

00:12:08.800 --> 00:12:10.040
...to stay alive.

00:12:10.710 --> 00:12:12.540
To stay alive?

00:12:13.040 --> 00:12:16.040
"Best to kill than be killed."

00:12:16.900 --> 00:12:20.120
My friend engraved that here.

00:12:23.480 --> 00:12:26.670
I'm your friend, Pino!

00:12:26.670 --> 00:12:28.850
My friend?

00:12:29.270 --> 00:12:34.510
We first met 1,796 days ago.

00:12:34.510 --> 00:12:35.710
Where?

00:12:35.710 --> 00:12:38.300
Before the Valvraves were completed,

00:12:38.300 --> 00:12:41.490
you and I were in the same place.

00:12:42.070 --> 00:12:44.870
You were the test pilot.

00:12:44.870 --> 00:12:46.620
That's what they called you.

00:12:48.370 --> 00:12:51.620
My container was tiny back then.

00:12:59.240 --> 00:13:02.480
You came to me every day.

00:13:03.360 --> 00:13:05.130
But you were lonely.

00:13:09.430 --> 00:13:14.390
I'm lonely too! Let's be friends!

00:13:14.770 --> 00:13:17.640
Friends? Really?

00:13:18.690 --> 00:13:20.510
Friends...

00:13:20.510 --> 00:13:22.030
I've never heard about those experiments.

00:13:22.560 --> 00:13:26.330
I ate the information you call "memories".

00:13:26.330 --> 00:13:28.530
Consumed them? Used them.

00:13:28.880 --> 00:13:30.780
Information? You mean the runes?

00:13:31.090 --> 00:13:31.870
Runes?

00:13:31.870 --> 00:13:33.540
Information particles.

00:13:34.120 --> 00:13:37.790
I see. The richest source of information in humans is their memories.

00:13:38.210 --> 00:13:41.550
So I don't have any memories because—

00:13:52.560 --> 00:13:54.890
Yamada! We've gotta fall back!

00:14:00.110 --> 00:14:01.020
Shit!

00:14:01.020 --> 00:14:02.190
Run!

00:14:08.960 --> 00:14:11.890
Runes. My food.

00:14:11.890 --> 00:14:13.890
I use them to move.

00:14:13.890 --> 00:14:15.320
No shape.

00:14:15.320 --> 00:14:16.480
Invisible.

00:14:16.480 --> 00:14:18.040
Energy.

00:14:18.040 --> 00:14:21.000
No way... You eat memories?

00:14:22.770 --> 00:14:26.800
I can't remember the entrance ceremony.

00:14:26.800 --> 00:14:34.140
How did I get to Sakimori Academy?

00:14:35.300 --> 00:14:40.310
Cherry blossoms? I think they were blooming.

00:14:41.330 --> 00:14:43.950
But I can't remember anything else.

00:14:43.950 --> 00:14:46.530
What did I do at the entrance ceremony?

00:14:47.380 --> 00:14:50.280
I used your runes.

00:14:51.120 --> 00:14:52.630
I see.

00:14:53.960 --> 00:14:56.230
So it was all related...

00:14:57.050 --> 00:15:01.680
The Valvraves... and my memories...

00:15:03.120 --> 00:15:09.010
And just now my oldest memory disappeared.

00:15:12.280 --> 00:15:13.760
Help!

00:15:14.060 --> 00:15:16.150
Units 3 and 5 are getting beat up.

00:15:16.150 --> 00:15:18.250
Unit 3 cooled down but still won't move!

00:15:18.250 --> 00:15:21.730
Unit 5 is almost out of impact booster coolers!

00:15:21.730 --> 00:15:23.770
My brother and the others have been found out, too!

00:15:24.180 --> 00:15:26.130
Units 4 and 6 can't move.

00:15:26.130 --> 00:15:27.940
Unit 1 is the only one left!

00:15:29.380 --> 00:15:30.650
I have to help them.

00:15:36.800 --> 00:15:40.870
Will I forget stuff again if I operate it?

00:15:41.540 --> 00:15:43.750
I told you to run, dumbass!

00:15:43.750 --> 00:15:45.300
As if I'd just leave you here!

00:15:47.110 --> 00:15:49.550
Take Unit 1, Nobi Marie.

00:15:49.550 --> 00:15:52.090
Otherwise, all your friends are bound to die.

00:15:52.790 --> 00:15:56.600
But I only have two years' worth of memories.

00:15:56.600 --> 00:15:59.100
The temperature keeps on rising!

00:15:59.100 --> 00:16:02.100
Why won't Unit 3 cool down?!

00:16:02.100 --> 00:16:04.350
Stop! Don't hurt him any more!

00:16:04.350 --> 00:16:07.170
I am their leader! The children have nothing to do with this!

00:16:07.170 --> 00:16:07.640
Teach!

00:16:07.640 --> 00:16:08.480
I talked them into it!

00:16:08.480 --> 00:16:09.950
Get going already!

00:16:09.950 --> 00:16:10.760
Help them!

00:16:10.760 --> 00:16:13.070
Where's Unit 1?! L-Elf?!

00:16:13.070 --> 00:16:15.750
But if I go, I'll forget again...

00:16:16.600 --> 00:16:17.870
Then let's make some new memories!

00:16:18.870 --> 00:16:20.690
We can't make a past for you,

00:16:20.690 --> 00:16:23.070
but we can give you a future!

00:16:23.070 --> 00:16:24.180
A future?

00:16:25.540 --> 00:16:27.880
Let's make some future memories together!

00:16:28.530 --> 00:16:29.880
Together?

00:16:30.210 --> 00:16:32.040
Yeah! Together!

00:16:32.040 --> 00:16:33.220
Let's be friends.

00:16:33.760 --> 00:16:35.220
Friends...

00:16:54.820 --> 00:16:57.200
Unit 1? Who's in it?

00:17:01.200 --> 00:17:03.800
One more won't make difference now!

00:17:03.800 --> 00:17:05.460
Take it out! Blume!

00:17:37.290 --> 00:17:39.970
Amazing! How can it do that?

00:17:39.970 --> 00:17:41.080
Tokishima Haruto.

00:17:41.390 --> 00:17:43.070
We're heading to the transport.

00:17:43.070 --> 00:17:45.950
You made Marie pilot it?!

00:17:45.950 --> 00:17:48.330
She used to be Unit 1's pilot.

00:17:48.330 --> 00:17:49.540
She was a pilot?

00:17:49.540 --> 00:17:51.090
The details can wait. This can't.

00:17:53.420 --> 00:17:56.300
It's fine. I'm still fine.

00:18:04.840 --> 00:18:08.190
Whoa! I've never seen it move like that!

00:18:08.440 --> 00:18:11.290
Memories and friendships can be made again.

00:18:11.290 --> 00:18:12.990
I'll keep fighting!

00:18:12.990 --> 00:18:13.690
No!

00:18:14.010 --> 00:18:17.440
Marie, you're broken! Your limiter is broken!

00:18:17.440 --> 00:18:19.360
You're losing too much information!

00:18:19.800 --> 00:18:22.960
That's why they wouldn't let you stay as a test pilot!

00:18:22.960 --> 00:18:25.370
Erasure! Loss!

00:18:30.500 --> 00:18:31.380
L-Elf!

00:18:31.740 --> 00:18:33.080
The operation's back on track.

00:18:33.080 --> 00:18:34.630
We're taking that transport.

00:18:40.590 --> 00:18:42.660
Not yet! I'm still fine!

00:18:42.660 --> 00:18:44.220
Even if I lose them, I can just make more later!

00:18:46.220 --> 00:18:47.390
There's the signal!

00:18:52.680 --> 00:18:55.650
Follow corridor 18 clockwise. Turn right.

00:18:55.650 --> 00:18:59.530
Once you're past the security door, continue 40 meters then turn left.

00:18:59.530 --> 00:19:00.910
Five blocks until the bridge.

00:19:10.120 --> 00:19:12.130
Not yet! Not yet!

00:19:17.380 --> 00:19:18.880
Just three more units!

00:19:23.180 --> 00:19:25.310
The rest's on you, Haruto!

00:19:34.480 --> 00:19:36.500
<i>We secured the transport.</i>

00:19:36.500 --> 00:19:38.660
<i>Enemy units left in 12% of the blocks.</i>

00:19:41.510 --> 00:19:42.360
<i>A hack?</i>

00:19:42.360 --> 00:19:45.420
People of New JIOR, do you copy?

00:19:45.420 --> 00:19:47.410
We are the Dorssian royalists.

00:19:47.410 --> 00:19:49.350
We are willing to offer you assistance.

00:19:49.350 --> 00:19:50.160
<i>Royalists?</i>

00:19:50.160 --> 00:19:51.870
Set your course to magnetic longitude 37—

00:19:52.160 --> 00:19:54.800
We're taking off. We'll pick up Unit 1 in the air.

00:19:54.800 --> 00:19:56.140
But we—

00:19:56.140 --> 00:19:57.380
Shut up and enjoy the scenery.

00:20:06.030 --> 00:20:08.580
Units 3 and 5 retrieved!

00:20:17.670 --> 00:20:18.630
It stopped!

00:20:18.630 --> 00:20:20.860
The lunar forces reported this phenomenon!

00:20:20.860 --> 00:20:22.150
It "overheated"!

00:20:28.040 --> 00:20:30.140
Marie! Marie!

00:20:31.080 --> 00:20:33.320
Are you okay? Hurt anywhere?

00:20:33.320 --> 00:20:35.500
Who are you?

00:20:36.790 --> 00:20:37.920
Are we friends?

00:20:38.360 --> 00:20:41.590
Of course! What are you talking about?

00:20:41.590 --> 00:20:44.930
Ah. We're friends.

00:20:47.100 --> 00:20:50.180
Are there others, too? Do I have other friends?

00:20:50.180 --> 00:20:52.420
You've got a really close friend!

00:20:52.420 --> 00:20:55.520
She's a bit of a doofus, but underneath, she just may be a genius!

00:20:55.520 --> 00:20:57.380
You said that about her!

00:20:57.380 --> 00:21:03.400
Ah. She must've been very dear to me.

00:21:05.240 --> 00:21:06.030
Marie?

00:21:06.850 --> 00:21:10.790
I see. So I had a friend like that.

00:21:11.140 --> 00:21:13.410
Marie? What happened?

00:21:14.040 --> 00:21:19.290
I'm glad I had a friend I liked so much.

00:21:48.980 --> 00:21:50.950
It's way stronger than it was in space!

00:22:21.400 --> 00:22:23.230
Marie! Marie!

00:22:24.450 --> 00:22:25.540
Are you okay?

00:22:26.570 --> 00:22:27.480
Marie?

00:22:28.080 --> 00:22:29.240
Marie?

00:22:33.100 --> 00:22:35.500
What's wrong? Respond!

